=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Stone County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 23% of normal in November to December and 44% in July to August. Grid 19352 had its driest year in 1980 at 59%.</p>"}
